// China Lake tier-3 fix (user 2026-07-05) - its CSV row carries the launcher is_aat_exempt flag (like the
// Mahem), so without this the PaP machine would hide after pack 2. Same un-exempt fix; our packs never
// aat::acquire, so no alt-ammo can leak in (visibility gate only). ALWAYS-SAFE: if the weapon isn't exempt
// this is a no-op (was_exempt=0). register_special_upgrades() (in _acc_weapon_variants) handles the tier-key
// mapping generically - no per-gun edit needed there.
function make_havoc_pap_visible_to_tier3()
{
